# {{senseid|en|Q180846}}A [[large]] [[self-service]] [[store]] that [[sell]]s [[groceries]] and, usually, [[medication]]s, [[household]] [[good]]s{{,}} and/or [[clothing]].
#: {{cot|en|hypermarket|superstore}}
#: {{ux|en|I went to the '''supermarket''' to buy some food.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|author=Lucy Hooker|title=Coca-Cola recalls drinks in UK due to chemical levels|magazine=w:BBC News|url=https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/czxkn393rwwo|date=2025-01-29|passage=Cans of Coca-Cola Original Taste, Coca-Cola Zero Sugar, Diet Coke, and Sprite Zero sent to cafes and restaurants are being withdrawn as well as 6x250ml Appletiser multipacks sent to UK '''supermarkets'''.|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20260922154115/https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/czxkn393rwwo|archivedate=22 September 2026}}
# A [[chain]] of such stores.
# {{lb|en|figurative}} A [[one-stop shop]]; a place offering a range of products or services.
#* {{quote-book|en|year=2011|author=Faith Glasgow|title=Personal Finance and Investing All-in-One For Dummies|passage=If you know what you want by filtering down the 1,600 or so trusts to a short list and then studying the information on each via online sources, then you can buy your trust and get all or nearly all of the commission back into your bank account via an Internet investment '''supermarket'''. Here, you select your fund, decide whether you want it as an Individual Savings Account (ISA), and pay for it with a credit card.}}
#* {{RQ:Guardian|author=Fiona Vera-Gray|quotee=Almina|title=‘Everything is hairless’: what 100 women taught me about porn and body confidence|date=2024-02-20|url=https://www.theguardian.com/society/2024/feb/20/everything-is-hairless-what-100-women-taught-me-about-porn-and-body-confidence|passage=Almina grew up in the age of the internet and the infinite '''supermarket''' of pornography it provides. |archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20261018105912/https://www.theguardian.com/society/2024/feb/20/everything-is-hairless-what-100-women-taught-me-about-porn-and-body-confidence|archivedate=18 October 2026}}

