===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|dere}}, from {{inh|en|ang|dēore}}, {{m|ang|dīere}}, {{m|ang|dīore}}, {{m|ang|dȳre|t=of great value or excellence, expensive, beloved}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*diurī}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*diurijaz|t=dear, precious; expensive}}, probably from {{inh|en|ine-pro|*dʰegʷʰ-|t=to burn; hot, warm}}. 
{{col-top|2|cog}}
Cognate with {{cog|yol|dear|t=dear}}, {{cog|stq|djuur|t=precious, dear, costly, expensive}}, {{cog|gsw|tüür|t=expensive}}, {{cog|nl|dier}}, {{m|nl|duur|t=expensive}}, {{cog|de|teuer|t=expensive}}, {{cog|wym|taojer}}, {{m|wym|tojer|t=dear}}, {{cog|vls|diere|t=expensive}}, {{cog|yi|טײַער|t=expensive}}, {{cog|da,nb,nn,sv|dyr|t=expensive}}, {{cog|fo|dýrur|t=expensive}}, {{cog|is|dýr|t=expensive}}, {{cog|fi|tyyris|t=expensive}}, {{cog|liv|tõurõz|t=dear}}, {{cog|se|divrras|t=expensive}}.
{{col-bottom}}

