[[File:Goat 01.jpg|thumb|Domestic goat ({{taxfmt|Capra hircus|species}})]]
[[File:PikiWiki Israel 38769 Male Ibex.jpg|thumb|[[Nubian ibex]] ({{taxlink|Capra nubiana|species}})]]

{{etymon|en|:inh|enm:goot|tree=1}}
{{inh+|en|enm|goot}}, {{m|enm|got}}, {{m|enm|gat}}, from {{inh|en|ang|gāt}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*gait}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*gaits}}, from a {{der|en|qfa-sub}} language.

The sense of ''[[lecherous]] [[man]]'' derives from the slang expression “[[horny]] as a goat”.

