** {{uxi|cy|Dw i'n mynd '''at''' y meddyg.|I'm going '''to''' the doctor.}}
*** but with a place: {{uxi|cy|Dw i'n mynd '''i''''r feddygfa.|I'm going '''to''' the surgery.}}
*** and also before a verb: {{uxi|cy|Dw i'n mynd '''i''' weld y meddyg.|I'm going '''to''' see the doctor.}}
** {{uxi|cy|Wnaeth hi anfon llythyr '''at''' Megan.|She sent a letter '''to''' Megan.}}
*** but with a place: {{uxi|cy|Wnaeth hi anfon llythyr '''i''' Gaerdydd.|She sent a letter '''to''' Cardiff.}}
*** and also before a verb: {{uxi|cy|Oedd hi'n mynd '''i''' anfon llythyr.|She was going '''to''' send a letter.}}
