# {{lb|en|architecture}} A {{l|en|portal}} of entry into a building, room, or vehicle, typically consisting of a rigid plane movable on a {{l|en|hinge}}. It may have a {{l|en|handle}} to help open and close, a {{l|en|latch}} to hold it closed{{,}} and a {{l|en|lock}} that ensures it cannot be opened without a key.
