helper.content:
{{also|Helper}}
==English==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|en|enm|helpere}}, from {{inh|en|ang|*helpere}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*helpārī|t=helper}}, equivalent to {{af|en|help|-er|id2=agent noun}}. Cognate with {{cog|stq|Hälper|t=helper}}, {{cog|fy|helper|t=helper}}, {{cog|nl|helper|t=helper}}, {{cog|nds-de|Helper|t=helper}}, {{cog|de|Helfer|t=helper}}, {{cog|da|hjælper|t=helper}}, {{cog|sv|hjälpare|t=helper}}, {{cog|is|hjálpar|t=helper}}.

===Pronunciation===
