===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|en|enm|slepen}}, from {{inh|en|ang-ang|slēpan}} ({{cog|ang-wsx|slǣpan}}), from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*slāpan}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*slēpaną|t=to sleep}}.
{{col-top|2|cog}}
Cognate with {{cog|frr|sleepe}}, {{m|frr|sliap}}, {{m|frr|sliip}}, {{m|frr|släipe|t=to sleep}}, {{cog|stq|släipe|t=to sleep}}, {{cog|fy|sliepe|t=to sleep}}, {{cog|gsw|schlaaffe}}, {{m|gsw|schlaafä}}, {{m|gsw|schlafe}}, {{m|gsw|schloafe}}, {{m|gsw|schloafen}}, {{m|gsw|schlofe}}, {{m|gsw|schlàfu|t=to sleep}}, {{cog|bar|schlofn}}, {{m|bar|schlåfn}}, {{m|bar|sghlofn|t=to sleep}}, {{cog|gmw-cfr|schlofe|t=to sleep}}, {{cog|cim|slaafan}}, {{m|cim|slafan}}, {{m|cim|slavan|t=to sleep}}, {{cog|nl,nds|slapen|t=to sleep}}, {{cog|de|schlafen|t=to sleep}}, {{cog|li|schloëpe}}, {{m|li|slaope|t=to sleep}}, {{cog|lb|schlofen|t=to sleep}}, {{cog|mhn|schloven|t=to sleep}}, {{cog|wym|šłȫfa}}, {{m|wym|śłöfa|t=to sleep}}, {{cog|yi|שלאָפֿן|t=to sleep}}, {{cog|gme-cgo|schlipen|t=to sleep}}, {{cog|got|𐍃𐌻𐌴𐍀𐌰𐌽|t=to sleep}}.
{{col-bottom}}

