* {{IPA|en|/əˈmeɪ.zɪnɡ/|[əˈmeɪ̯.zɪŋɡ]|a=non-ng-coalescence}}
* {{rhymes|en|eɪzɪŋ|s=3}}
* {{hyph|en|a|ma|zing}}

===Verb===
{{head|en|verb form}}

# {{infl of|en|amaze||ing-form}}
#* {{RQ:Fryer New Account|page=375|passage=Falling into her uſual Trance, ſhe at that inſtant wrought their Fancies to be perſuaded of the confuſed Articulation of Multitudes met as in a Fair, converſing and making a chattering, to the '''amazing''' of them all.}}
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1848|author=John Bunyan; Robert Philip|title=The Greatness of the Soul: And the Unspeakableness of the Loss Thereof|page=29|publisher=T. Nelson
|passage=How many things have men found out to the '''amazing''' of one another, to the wonderment of one another, to the begetting of endless commendations of one another in the world}}
#* {{quote-newsgroup|en|date=August 5 1996|author=Tim Behrendsen|title=Tim Behrendsen Lost and Spaced THE FINAL TRY|newsgroup=rec.games.computer.quake.misc
|passage='''Amazing''' is judged relative what already exists, and Quake has the best underwater effects so far.}}
#* {{quote-newsgroup|en|date=November 30 1997|author=Sir Frederick|title=Pro-Mormons are amazing also|newsgroup=alt.religion.mormon.fellowship
|passage=Reality, especially God's Reality is amazing. For instance that there is something rather than nothing is amazing. [''...''] '''Amazing''' is amazing.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=July 13 1999|author=Irma Dobkin; Mary Jo Peterson|journal=Gracious Spaces|page=xix|publisher=McGraw-Hill Professional
|passage=The '''amazing''' is happening.}}
#* {{quote-newsgroup|en|date=March 24 2000|author=Shadow|title=Return of the Fulgore Rant!|newsgroup=alt.fan.dragons
|passage=All that is impossibly amazing is considered nothing, and the impossibly '''amazing''' is considered normal.}}
#* {{quote-newsgroup|en|date=February 3 2001|author=Brian|title=D3 weird FPS|newsgroup=alt.games.descent
|passage=The '''amazing''' is that, in EXACTLY the same situation, the demo2 doesn't show this problem.}}
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=June 23 2003|author=Thomas Bernhard|journal=Three Novellas|page=31|publisher=University of Chicago Press
|passage=Everything that amazes has its method, until we notice that the '''amazing''' is not amazing, has no method.}}
#* {{quote-newsgroup|en|date=October 23 2004|author=MgClearwater|title=George says: Joe and Brian stay..|newsgroup=alt.sports.baseball.ny-yankees
|passage=Sheffield is an amazing athlete, how much of the '''amazing''' is provided from the Chemlab.}}
#* '''2006''' May 16, Simon Baird, "monkeyGTD is amazing- a few questions and suggestions", {{monospace|GTD TiddlyWiki}}, ''Google goups''
#*: Cool! Of course 99% of the '''amazing''' is due to the "powered by TiddlyWiki" part of MonkeyGTD.. :)

===Adjective===
{{en-adj}}

# Causing [[wonder]] and [[amazement]]; very [[surprising]].
#* {{quote-journal|en|journal=People Magazine|title=Charlize Theron Says Swaddling’s ‘Pretty Amazing’|date=March 16, 2012|passage=“It’s been '''amazing''', the amount of emails and congratulations,” the Snow White and the Huntsman star, 36, told Ryan Seacrest Friday on his radio show.}}
# {{lb|en|informal}} Possessing [[uniquely]] [[wonderful]] qualities; very [[good]].
#* {{quote-journal|en|journal=People Magazine|title=Charlize Theron Says Swaddling’s ‘Pretty Amazing’|date=March 16, 2012|passage=“I didn’t think I would be a fan of the swaddling, but the swaddling’s pretty '''amazing''',” she says.}}
#* '''2014''', November 6, WAAY-TV (Huntsville, AL), ''VIDEO: "Sitting next to him was '''amazing'''" says student of General Via''
#*: "I think it was pretty '''amazing''' that he picked our school out of a lot of schools to come speak to us about what he has done, and what our country has done, to help us gain our freedom," Mucci said, “sitting next to him was '''amazing'''.”
#* '''2014''', November 8, Nick McCarvel, "Wozniacki's marathon debut was '''amazing''', Djokovic says", ''USA TODAY'' Sports
#*: "Running a marathon is definitely an '''amazing''' experience."
#* {{quote-web|en|date=June 10 2015|author=Lindsey Bever|title=Morning Mix: Another reason seeing-eye dogs are '''amazing'''|site=washingtonpost.com|url=http://www.washingtonpost.com/news/morning-mix/wp/2015/06/10/another-heroic-story-showing-why-seeing-eye-dogs-are-amazing/}}

